    <guid isPermaLink="false">627137a6bf39836fd02b7b53</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 May 2022 14:09:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>本期主播：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>鱼导 | 微博@</span><a href="https://weibo.com/1789738343/profile?topnav=1&amp;wvr=6" data-url="https://weibo.com/1789738343/profile?topnav=1&amp;wvr=6"><span>鲸鱼先生吃东西</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>Murat | 「加拉塔土耳其小厨」老板</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Crystal | 「加拉塔土耳其小厨」亲友团</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>本期内容：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="237">03:57</a> | 土耳其美食到底好在哪儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> | 土耳其甜品最大的特点：甜！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a> | 被土耳其人几乎要写进法律里的酸奶里不许加蜂蜜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="965">16:05</a> | 世界闻名的土耳其冰激凌：逗你玩儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a> | 土耳其菜也向精致方向发展了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> | 巴西烤肉和土耳其烤肉是什么关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> | 在土耳其人心中 土耳其咖啡世界第一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">30:53</a> | 用内蒙土豆和新疆番茄酱做土耳其菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2006">33:26</a> | 天津人在吃饭这件事上排外吗</span></p>]]></description>
