  <item>
    <title>004.走遍全国为b站拍美食纪录片的男人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/626fc05f3e8abf901a68d914</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">626fc05f3e8abf901a68d914</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 May 2022 11:28:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>本期主播：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>鱼导 | 微博@</span><a href="https://weibo.com/1789738343/profile?topnav=1&amp;wvr=6" data-url="https://weibo.com/1789738343/profile?topnav=1&amp;wvr=6"><span>鲸鱼先生吃东西</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>李芗 | 《生活如沸》总导演</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>本期内容：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> | 和b站合作就像谈恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="202">03:22</a> | 大众对美食纪录片的需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> | 美食题材让大家走近纪录片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="306">05:06</a> | 赚b站的钱是一种什么感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> | 完成《生活如沸》用了16个月</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> | 《生活如沸》想把滚烫的人生融入火锅的意象中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> | 供应商眼中的b站</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1102">18:22</a> | 做美食纪录片的困难与享受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> | 为拍美食纪录片走遍全国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1716">28:36</a> | 对于拍摄纪录片来说最重要的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> | 作为b站供应商的核心竞争力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2591">43:11</a> | 家乡天津是个美人胚子</span></p>]]></description>
