  <item>
    <title>003.我在法国做甜品——给想开甜品店的你的一些建议</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/626c82b33e8abf901a68d7bb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">626c82b33e8abf901a68d7bb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Apr 2022 00:28:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>本期主播：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>鱼导 | 废柴导演</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>ZOZO | 「bitter sweetie」合伙人/厨房总监</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> | 法国「蓝带」和「费朗迪」的区别在哪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">04:52</a> | 在法国学甜品，学校重要还是经历重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">06:32</a> | 法式甜品的最大特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="472">07:52</a> | 「费朗迪」的教学方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> | 在法国综合甜品店的实习经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a> | 法式甜品在中国的发展阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> | 开甜品店能发财吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="974">16:14</a> | 在中国和在外国学甜品的差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> | 给要去学甜品的你的一些建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a> | 学甜品要准备多少钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1285">21:25</a> | 开甜品店需要大量的准备工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">22:55</a> | 甜品只讲「传统」不讲「正宗」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> | 欧洲国家对手艺人的推崇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> | 开甜品店到底是为了什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1688">28:08</a> | 来自专业人士的推荐</span></p>]]></description>
