  <item>
    <title>002.中国精品咖啡只是「看上去很美」？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/622760d59eb22e46ffe6c276</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">622760d59eb22e46ffe6c276</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Mar 2022 13:57:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>本期主播：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>鱼导 | 微博@</span><a href="https://weibo.com/1789738343/profile?topnav=1&amp;wvr=6" data-url="https://weibo.com/1789738343/profile?topnav=1&amp;wvr=6"><span>鲸鱼先生吃东西</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>豆腐 | 资深咖啡从业者/「半半咖啡」老板</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>本期内容：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">03:23</a> | 进入咖啡行业的「冲动型」创业者越来越少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> | 中国的咖啡市场究竟到了一个怎样的阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="343">05:43</a> | 业内人士如何看待今天的「瑞幸咖啡」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> | 「瑞幸」和「星巴克」到底是怎样的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a> | 中国的「精品咖啡」真实现状如何</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> | 如何平衡你的咖啡理想与生存需求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> | 大陆和台湾的咖啡氛围有何不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> | 精品咖啡会不会慢慢「果味化」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1572">26:12</a> | 精品咖啡一杯动辄百元合理吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1838">30:38</a> | 咖啡一定要走资本路线吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> | 给想进入咖啡行业的年轻人的大实话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2227">37:07</a> | 业内人士喜欢哪家咖啡店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2476">41:16</a> | 咖啡避雷指南</span></p>]]></description>
