    <title>001.两位精酿啤酒比赛裁判的行业「自曝」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/620e4d7230fca3133c0f7fbb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">620e4d7230fca3133c0f7fbb</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Feb 2022 13:28:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>本期主播：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>鱼导 | 微博@</span><a href="https://weibo.com/1789738343/profile?topnav=1&amp;wvr=6&amp;is_all=1" data-url="https://weibo.com/1789738343/profile?topnav=1&amp;wvr=6&amp;is_all=1"><span>鲸鱼先生吃东西</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>四三 | 「青门啤酒」创始人 全国精酿比赛裁判</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小刘 | 「青门啤酒」创始人 全国精酿比赛裁判</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>本期内容：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a> | 放弃学习酿造葡萄酒 改投精酿啤酒的怀抱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> | 小刘的「渣男」经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a> | 好兄弟是从共享同一位「Tony老师」开始的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> | 什么样的人才能成为精酿比赛的裁判</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">11:14</a> | 精酿比赛中那些令人印象深刻的故事和事故</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="927">15:27</a> | 精酿比赛裁判的评判标准到底是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> | 中国精酿啤酒的大环境如何</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1284">21:24</a> | 精酿啤酒越来越贵是怎么回事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a> | 精酿酒馆选酒越来越偏女性化是怎么回事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> | 小刘老师的精酿推荐时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> | 当爱好变成工作 快乐是否被打了折扣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1751">29:11</a> | 选择精酿啤酒的「避坑」指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> | 精酿从业者的酒量怎么样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2178">36:18</a> | 既是裁判 也是酿酒师 如何避嫌</span></p>]]></description>
